Package: SPmodels
Type: Package
Title: Spatial Models for Research and Teaching
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person(given = "Olatunji", family = "Johnson",
    email = "olatunjijohnson21111@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Independently implemented spatial modelling methods with a
    formula-oriented interface, transparent uncertainty, and mathematical
    derivations for research and teaching. This development snapshot contains
    the explicitly documented and tested implementation subset described in
    the project guide; external validation and release gates remain open.
